<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <title>New Expense Request</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f4f4f4; margin: 0; padding: 20px; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.1); }
    .header { background: #f59e0b; color: #fff; padding: 24px 32px; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; }
    .body { padding: 32px; color: #333; }
    .meta { background: #f9fafb; border-radius: 6px; padding: 16px; margin-top: 20px; }
    .meta p { margin: 6px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280; }
    .meta strong { color: #111827; }
    .cta { display: inline-block; background: #f59e0b; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 24px; font-weight: bold; }
    .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px 32px; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header"><h1>New Expense Request</h1></div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Hi {{firstName}},</p>
      <p>A new expense request has been submitted and requires your review.</p>
      <div class="meta">
        <p><strong>Submitted By:</strong> {{staffName}}</p>
        <p><strong>Expense:</strong> {{expenseTitle}}</p>
        <p><strong>Amount:</strong> KES {{amount}}</p>
        {{#if category}}<p><strong>Category:</strong> {{category}}</p>{{/if}}
        {{#if eventName}}<p><strong>Event:</strong> {{eventName}}</p>{{/if}}
        <p><strong>Date:</strong> {{date}}</p>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top:20px;">Please log in to review and approve or reject this expense.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">Spendy &mdash; Smart Expense Management</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
